      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City staff report Jan 28, 2025: Council approved a similar project on the site on May 11, 2021, which expired May 11, 2023. The 2025 proposal differs only in retaining two more Heritage trees and relocating one; it removes eight Heritage trees. Site has one existing 1-story single-family home; zoning R3-3/sd, General Plan Medium-Density Residential. Approvals: PUD Permit, Special Design Permit, Development Review Permit, Heritage Tree Removal Permit and a Vesting Tentative Map for five lots and one common lot.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report 2021 Table A2 shows 4 units entitled on 2021-05-11 under PL-2018-087, with the note \"5 Rowhomes to replace 1 SFR\"; 2025 Table A2 shows 5 units entitled 2025-01-28 under PL-2024-018.",
